The VoxelGI investigation's animations
======================================

The viewer's Play animation of each demonstration (its file's `animation`): the values at the demonstration's
time `t`, in seconds, each a sine wave about its centre (`wave center amplitude period t`).

$[Import* std]$[Import* render_lab_runtime]$[Import* godot_voxelgi_values]

VoxelGI's light faded in and out.
$[# playMix {: {^ {t} {' {setVoxelgiMix {wave 0.5 0.5 10.0 t}}}} Animation}]

The bounds' steps, one after another.
$[# playBounds {: {^ {t} {' {setBoundsStep {wave 1.0 1.0 10.0 t}}}} Animation}]

A triangle's descent through the octree's levels.
$[# playOctree {: {^ {t} {' {setDescentLevel {wave 3.5 3.5 14.0 t}}}} Animation}]

The cut through the cells rises and falls.
$[# playCells {: {^ {t} {' {setCutHeight {wave 1.6 1.5 12.0 t}}}} Animation}]

The distance field's slice rises and falls.
$[# playField {: {^ {t} {' {setSliceHeight {wave 1.2 1.0 14.0 t}}}} Animation}]

The light moves across the room.
$[# playLight {: {^ {t} {' {setLightX {wave 0.0 2.2 14.0 t}}}} Animation}]

A cone's march, sample by sample.
$[# playBounce {: {^ {t} {' {setConeSteps {wave 8.0 8.0 12.0 t}}}} Animation}]

The propagation rises and falls.
$[# playMips {: {^ {t} {' {setPropagation {wave 0.5 0.5 12.0 t}}}} Animation}]

The dynamic object moves across the room.
$[# playDynamic {: {^ {t} {' {setDynamicX {wave 0.5 1.0 14.0 t}}}} Animation}]

The worked pixel moves around the sphere.
$[# playPixel {: {^ {t} {' {setPixelAzimuth {wave 75.0 25.0 16.0 t}}}} Animation}]

The quality setting rises and falls.
$[# playCost {: {^ {t} {' {setQuality {wave 0.5 0.5 8.0 t}}}} Animation}]
